  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Hautboys and torches. Enter, and pass over, a Sewer and divers Servants with dishes and service. Then enter Macbeth."
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "macbeth",
        "name": "MACBETH",
        "displayName": "Macbeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "If it were done when 'tis done, then 'twere well",
          "plainText": "If it were done when 'tis done then 'twere well",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "It were done quickly. If th' assassination",
          "plainText": "It were done quickly If th' assassination",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Could trammel up the consequence, and catch",
          "plainText": "Could trammel up the consequence and catch",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "With his surcease success; that but this blow",
          "plainText": "With his surcease success that but this blow",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Might be the be-all and the end-all—here,",
          "plainText": "Might be the beall and the endallhere",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "But here, upon this bank and shoal of time,",
          "plainText": "But here upon this bank and shoal of time",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "We'd jump the life to come. But in these cases",
          "plainText": "We'd jump the life to come But in these cases",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "We still have judgement here; that we but teach",
          "plainText": "We still have judgement here that we but teach",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Bloody instructions, which being taught, return",
          "plainText": "Bloody instructions which being taught return",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "To plague th' inventor. This even-handed justice",
          "plainText": "To plague th' inventor This evenhanded justice",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "Commends th' ingredience of our poison'd chalice",
          "plainText": "Commends th' ingredience of our poison'd chalice",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "To our own lips. He's here in double trust:",
          "plainText": "To our own lips He's here in double trust",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "First, as I am his kinsman and his subject,",
          "plainText": "First as I am his kinsman and his subject",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 14,
          "text": "Strong both against the deed; then, as his host,",
          "plainText": "Strong both against the deed then as his host",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 15,
          "text": "Who should against his murderer shut the door,",
          "plainText": "Who should against his murderer shut the door",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 16,
          "text": "Not bear the knife myself. Besides, this Duncan",
          "plainText": "Not bear the knife myself Besides this Duncan",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 17,
          "text": "Hath borne his faculties so meek, hath been",
          "plainText": "Hath borne his faculties so meek hath been",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 18,
          "text": "So clear in his great office, that his virtues",
          "plainText": "So clear in his great office that his virtues",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 19,
          "text": "Will plead like angels, trumpet-tongued, against",
          "plainText": "Will plead like angels trumpettongued against",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 20,
          "text": "The deep damnation of his taking-off;",
          "plainText": "The deep damnation of his takingoff",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 21,
          "text": "And pity, like a naked new-born babe,",
          "plainText": "And pity like a naked newborn babe",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 22,
          "text": "Striding the blast, or heaven's cherubin, hors'd",
          "plainText": "Striding the blast or heaven's cherubin hors'd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 23,
          "text": "Upon the sightless couriers of the air,",
          "plainText": "Upon the sightless couriers of the air",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 24,
          "text": "Shall blow the horrid deed in every eye,",
          "plainText": "Shall blow the horrid deed in every eye",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 25,
          "text": "That tears shall drown the wind.—I have no spur",
          "plainText": "That tears shall drown the windI have no spur",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 26,
          "text": "To prick the sides of my intent, but only",
          "plainText": "To prick the sides of my intent but only",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 27,
          "text": "Vaulting ambition, which o'erleaps itself",
          "plainText": "Vaulting ambition which o'erleaps itself",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 28,
          "text": "And falls on th' other—",
          "plainText": "And falls on th' other",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Lady Macbeth."
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-macbeth",
        "name": "LADY MACBETH",
        "displayName": "Lady Macbeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "He has almost supp'd. Why have you left the chamber?",
          "plainText": "He has almost supp'd Why have you left the chamber",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "macbeth",
        "name": "MACBETH",
        "displayName": "Macbeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Hath he ask'd for me?",
          "plainText": "Hath he ask'd for me",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-macbeth",
        "name": "LADY MACBETH",
        "displayName": "Lady Macbeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Know you not he has?",
          "plainText": "Know you not he has",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "macbeth",
        "name": "MACBETH",
        "displayName": "Macbeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "We will proceed no further in this business:",
          "plainText": "We will proceed no further in this business",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "He hath honour'd me of late; and I have bought",
          "plainText": "He hath honour'd me of late and I have bought",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Golden opinions from all sorts of people,",
          "plainText": "Golden opinions from all sorts of people",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Which would be worn now in their newest gloss,",
          "plainText": "Which would be worn now in their newest gloss",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0036",
          "number": 36,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Not cast aside so soon.",
          "plainText": "Not cast aside so soon",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-macbeth",
        "name": "LADY MACBETH",
        "displayName": "Lady Macbeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0037",
          "number": 37,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Was the hope drunk",
          "plainText": "Was the hope drunk",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0038",
          "number": 38,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Wherein you dress'd yourself? Hath it slept since?",
          "plainText": "Wherein you dress'd yourself Hath it slept since",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0039",
          "number": 39,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "And wakes it now, to look so green and pale",
          "plainText": "And wakes it now to look so green and pale",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0040",
          "number": 40,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "At what it did so freely? From this time",
          "plainText": "At what it did so freely From this time",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0041",
          "number": 41,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Such I account thy love. Art thou afeard",
          "plainText": "Such I account thy love Art thou afeard",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0042",
          "number": 42,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "To be the same in thine own act and valour",
          "plainText": "To be the same in thine own act and valour",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0043",
          "number": 43,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "As thou art in desire? Wouldst thou have that",
          "plainText": "As thou art in desire Wouldst thou have that",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0044",
          "number": 44,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "Which thou esteem'st the ornament of life,",
          "plainText": "Which thou esteem'st the ornament of life",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0045",
          "number": 45,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "And live a coward in thine own esteem,",
          "plainText": "And live a coward in thine own esteem",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0046",
          "number": 46,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "Letting \"I dare not\" wait upon \"I would,\"",
          "plainText": "Letting I dare not wait upon I would",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0047",
          "number": 47,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "Like the poor cat i' th' adage?",
          "plainText": "Like the poor cat i' th' adage",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "macbeth",
        "name": "MACBETH",
        "displayName": "Macbeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0048",
          "number": 48,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Pr'ythee, peace!",
          "plainText": "Pr'ythee peace",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0049",
          "number": 49,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "I dare do all that may become a man;",
          "plainText": "I dare do all that may become a man",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0050",
          "number": 50,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Who dares do more is none.",
          "plainText": "Who dares do more is none",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth-1-7-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-macbeth",
        "name": "LADY MACBETH",
        "displayName": "Lady Macbeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0051",
          "number": 51,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What beast was't, then,",
          "plainText": "What beast was't then",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0052",
          "number": 52,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "That made you break this enterprise to me?",
          "plainText": "That made you break this enterprise to me",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0053",
          "number": 53,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "When you durst do it, then you were a man;",
          "plainText": "When you durst do it then you were a man",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0054",
          "number": 54,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "And, to be more than what you were, you would",
          "plainText": "And to be more than what you were you would",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0055",
          "number": 55,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Be so much more the man. Nor time nor place",
          "plainText": "Be so much more the man Nor time nor place",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0056",
          "number": 56,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Did then adhere, and yet you would make both:",
          "plainText": "Did then adhere and yet you would make both",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0057",
          "number": 57,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "They have made themselves, and that their fitness now",
          "plainText": "They have made themselves and that their fitness now",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0058",
          "number": 58,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "Does unmake you. I have given suck, and know",
          "plainText": "Does unmake you I have given suck and know",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0059",
          "number": 59,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "How tender 'tis to love the babe that milks me:",
          "plainText": "How tender 'tis to love the babe that milks me",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0060",
          "number": 60,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "I would, while it was smiling in my face,",
          "plainText": "I would while it was smiling in my face",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0061",
          "number": 61,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "Have pluck'd my nipple from his boneless gums",
          "plainText": "Have pluck'd my nipple from his boneless gums",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0062",
          "number": 62,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "And dash'd the brains out, had I so sworn as you",
          "plainText": "And dash'd the brains out had I so sworn as you",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth-1-7-line-0063",
          "number": 63,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "Have done to this.",
          "plainText": "Have done to this",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
